              "description": {
                "type": "textComponent",
                "text": "Abhishek has 10 years of  work experience and specialises in  the Banking financial Services, Insurance and Regulatory sectors. Currently he's based out of London (UK) working as a Senior Consultant in Cognizant’s IT Digital Business Consulting Practice helping a range of Fortune 500 clients solve their unique business problems by leveraging latest the information technology solutions.\n\nProduct Manager/Product Owner: Accustomed to working as part of senior management teams within business units, Abhishek works closely with the senior stakeholders right from the inception stage to define the vision of the product/platform and develop a product roll out strategy accounting for impact on existing teams, products/platforms, business and processes. He works across cross functional teams – Sales , Marketing, Biz Ops to understand the problem areas and elicit the business and the functional requirements and conceptualises features for the product to alleviate those pain points. Abhishek conceptualises user journeys for the end user of the platform/ product, wireframes etc to ensure end users have a seamless customer experience thus ensuring enhanced customer retention, lesser call volumes and enhanced customer engagement with the product thereby providing business value to organisations.\nBusiness Analyst : Abhishek has a strong background in running requirement gathering sessions, eliciting requirements, process flow mapping, gap analysis, user story writing and working closely with development teams in both Agile and waterfall models of SDLC. \nProject Manager : Driving technological innovation / transformation programs to support corporate strategies and promote a culture of transparency in delivery through stakeholder management, reporting and working within the governance framework with teams and suppliers to ensure they are engaged supporting outcome of delivery."
              }
